  m_text: "The characters on this coin exhibit Emperor Huizong\u2019s distinctive
    calligraphic style, known as \u201Cslender gold\u201D because it resembled finely
    spun filaments of the precious metal. The emperor\u2019s writings were often
    carved in stone or metal, as here, and circulated widely among the public."
